[0.546, "o", "\u001b[7mTask 4: Open Source\u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[7mClone this repo\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mNote I want to see these files in Github so you might want to read about git submodule\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mCreate a Makefile that compiles the program\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mMake sure the makefile can compile the program, \"clean\" the build artifacts, and run the compiled program\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mYou can find lots of helpful information here\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[7mMake sure I can see you compiling, cleaning, and running you program with make in your cast file\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
